  "note": "The two verb keys return the same Hebrew occurrences, as do the paired keys for deceit and slackness. Judges 9:31 has also been taken as a place name. Pomegranates, Rimmon and the word for a spear have other consonants. The name Jeremiah may instead be related to רום."
